      ],
      "source": "https://www.somosmayfair.org/somos-blog/2023/1/3/10-east-san-jose-spots-to-visit"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Mexican Heritage Plaza, located at 1700 Alum Rock Ave, is a historic gathering spot that hosts annual Dia de los Muertos celebrations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.sanjose.org/neighborhoods/mayfair"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A five‑mile Memorial Walkway links Plaza de Cesar Chavez to the Mexican Heritage Plaza, marked by olive‑colored signs honoring farmworkers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.sanjose.org/neighborhoods/mayfair"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mayfair’s community spirit shines through events like the yearly Dia de los Muertos, where Aztec dancers and artisan vendors bring culture to life.",
